problems.statement:
Let $M$ be the centroid of $	riangle ABC$. Prove the inequality
$$
\sin \angle CAM + \sin \angle CBM \le \frac{2}{\sqrt{3}}
$$
(a) if the circumscribed circle of $	riangle AMC$ is tangent to the line $AB$;

(b) for any $	riangle ABC$.

